00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.790 align:start position:0%
 
my name is lieutenant richard  r-i-c-h-a-r-d myers  m-e-y-e-r-s and i'm the lieutenant of  our lbmpd sex crime section  thank you for coming out this morning  the reason that we asked each of you to  come here today  was to highlight some of the work that  my section has done  and to reach out and ask for additional  victims to come forward  should there be any the men that you see  here  to my left are men that have con  committed multiple sexual assaults in  the las vegas  valley victimizing numerous female  victims  within our jurisdiction the good news is  that each of these cases has led to the  arrest of these suspects  and they are currently going through the  criminal justice process  in some of the cases victims were  prostitutes  in our area and others not the victims  were not prostitutes  they just happened to be in areas where  prostitution activity occurs  these suspects we believe thought it  would be easy to target these women  and what i'm sure that they didn't count  on was a team of detectives  who were willing to work exhaustively to  bring them  and hold them accountable for the  actions that they occurred  each of these men is considered a  violent predator  and we suspect that there are additional  victims and we're asking them  to come forward with information  at this time these cases all have  similarities  many of these crimes occurred in areas  known for prostitution activity  that's not to say that each of these  victims was a prostitute  it just means that they were in that  area once arrested  the suspects and the investigations that  led to their arrest  show that there was an increase in  violence from the beginning of their  criminal activity  to the time that they were arrested  regardless of the socioeconomic  demographic  or the victims initial willingness to go  forward with their case  an exhaustive investigation occurred in  order to hold these suspects accountable  these investigations included numerous  sections of the lvmpd  to include the homicide sex crimes  bureau the southern nevada  counterterrorism center  the criminalistic bureau numerous lvmpd  patrol area commands  device section the major violators  section  and the lvmpd pio office the other thing  that is unique about some of these  investigations  are that there were citizens who are  willing to see something and say  something  and as we roll into the new year's eve  time of year for the lvmpd  we ask citizens who see something that  doesn't look right  to come forward and pass their  information to the police department so  that we can conduct  investigations on that situation that  didn't look right  these citizens were willing to be good  witnesses and they were willing to  assist with the lvmpd investigations  their cooperation was instrumental in  solving some of these crimes  and finally on december 11 2020  the last suspect that you see there  jorge perez  agreed to meet a female on an online  dating application  once mr perez met the female victim in  the 5000 block of east sahara  he violently sexually assaulted her at  gunpoint  an investigation occurred and mr perez  was located and arrested for that crime  on december 14th we sent out a press  release asking for additional victims to  come forward  because as i stated before each of these  investigations has led  us to learn that many times once a  suspect is arrested for a sex crime  it's not the first time that they've  committed it  the previous investigations let us lead  us to believe that there are additional  victims associated with mr perez  and we're asking anyone with information  regarding mr perez  or any of the other three predators that  you see there on those pictures  to contact the lvmpd sexual assault  section at 702-828-34  or crime stoppers as always with crime  stoppers any information  leading to an arrest and conviction may  have reward money attached to it  and with that i'll take any a question a  few questions  so we haven't seen an increase on sex  worker victims  this is just kind of to show you some of  the work that my section has done  and to let the public know that again  regardless of  the victims socioeconomic  you know background etc the lvmpd is  going to conduct a thorough  investigation  i can so and the lvmpdpio is also going  to provide some information out  the first predator that you see here is  michael nixon  michael nixon committed crimes in  january february and march and was  arrested in march  the second subject that you see there is  jamar reed the investigation into mr  reed began in april  and as we conducted our investigation we  were able to link him back to  approximately eight sexual assaults that  occurred in the area of washington and  i-15  and the third subject that you see there  is louis moreno  louis moreno has now been linked to six  sexual assaults and robberies that  occurred in the lvmpd jurisdiction  all of that information was provided in  previous press releases as well  okay if there's no additional questions  yes ma'am one more question um  so i think some of the key safety steps  that women and men can take in online  dating platforms is to first of all meet  in a public area  um that that is my my best  recommendation for safety whether it be  a local bar  um a local restaurant something of that  nature where the public is around  and then before you move into a private  area with that person that you don't  really know  get to know them first and that that  would be  what i would recommend is you know  keeping that interaction in public until  you're comfortable with that person  last one um  so that's a great question thank you for  asking that sex crimes is different than  any other crime we investigate in the  lvmpd the victim controls the tempo of  that investigation  what i would ask is if they're on the  fence on whether or not to report  come and report and then my detectives  will work with those victims and when  they feel comfortable  for their investigation to go forward we  will activate those investigations and  go forward  all right thank you i appreciate you  guys coming out this morning and have a  safe and merry christmas

